---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Seoul E-Land Digest">
  <article class="prose-eland">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Round-by-round tactical coverage of Seoul E-Land FC (서울이랜드FC), a
      K League 2 side based in eastern Seoul.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site is built for English-speaking supporters who want more context
      around each match: how Seoul E-Land played, which players shaped the result,
      and what each round means for the promotion race.
    </p>
    <h2>Coverage</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>K League 2 league rounds</li>
      <li>FA Cup and other domestic cup ties</li>
      <li>Squad changes, transfers, and front-office news</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Editorial</h2>
    <p>
      Opinions are mine. The "honest read" section at the end of each digest
      is where I step back from the match recap and give a clearer read on what
      the result really means.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
